# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PUBLIC REPO — ALLOWLIST GITIGNORE
#
# This repo is the LinkedIn-facing showcase for Member 360.
# It is managed exclusively by the sync script in member-360-private.
#
#   RULE: Everything is ignored by default.
#         Only explicitly allowed paths can be tracked.
#
# This means `git add -A` is SAFE — it cannot accidentally stage
# files that don't belong here, no matter what ends up on disk.
#
# To add a new path: update PUBLIC_MANIFEST in member-360-private
# AND add a negation pattern here, then run the sync script.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Step 1: Block everything at the root level ───────────────────
/*

# ── Step 2: Allow specific root-level files ──────────────────────
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/demo.sh

# ── Step 3: Allow specific root-level directories ────────────────
#    (must allow the directory BEFORE allowing its contents)
!/backend/
!/frontend/
!/docs/
!/prototypes/
!/archive/
!/tests/

# ── Step 4: Allow all contents within allowed directories ────────
!backend/**
!frontend/**

# docs: only the architecture subfolder — block everything else in docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/architecture/
!/docs/architecture/**

# prototypes: only the demo subfolder — block everything else in prototypes/
/prototypes/*
!/prototypes/demo/
!/prototypes/demo/**

!archive/**
!tests/**

# ── Always exclude regardless of the above ───────────────────────
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.env
*.env.*
node_modules/
*.db
*.sqlite
vectorstore/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.zip